  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br />For stable equilibrium potential energy should be minimum and <math> <mrow> <mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;when</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>= 1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>&#160;and</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; are on same direction.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/328573cb-6b12-4e23-99c4-bde6d88cb896-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 179px;\" /></p>",
